{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左からアミちゃん\n昔からディズニーやご飯食べに行くのもお泊まりも何かあると誘ってくれるお転婆なあみちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして隣のひなちゃん！\nまあやの１つ上なんだけどそんなとは思えないくらい何事にも冷静なクールビューティーちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人だなーって思うけどよく笑うとこも好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学の時まあやが学校行きにくくなった時\nなんかあったの？大丈夫？って声かけてくれたこと...ずっとまあやは忘れないなーっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちゃんは忘れてると思うけどっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく嬉しかったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてこの前もろってぃーと原宿と表参道ぷらぷらしてお洋服見たりカフェ行ったりと\nカフェは2件行ったんだけど、ろってぃーは2件ともカフェラテ注文してて、おしゃれな大人だなーと思いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃーは元気いっぱいな綺麗なお姉ちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人の気持ちを考えることのできる本当に素敵な女性"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"尊敬することばかりで...\nだいすきっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この写真は個別握手会の時の写真だよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カープじゃないよ 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この真っ赤な大きめの服は、ろってぃーと買い物行った時にろってぃーが選んでくれた服"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会ではろってぃーが選びそーかわいいね❤似合ってるって言われて嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃーありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会ではお正月のお話やモバメでよく 送ってるお料理のお話...番組等々...今回も沢山のお話できて嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなの笑顔を見るととってもpowerがみなぎってきて逆に皆さんから元気と笑顔をもらってる気しかしなくて..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もらってばっかじゃダメだなぁ..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来れない方からのコメントもありがとうございます。次回を楽しみにしてます！体調には気をつけてくださいね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前楽屋みなみとかずみんとまあやで座ってて、次の日も同じ現場だったの、なぜだかよくわからないけどメンバーは次の日も同じだと大抵次の日も同じ席に座るの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもまあやはパッと見たとき席が少し変わってて昨日の場所がわかりにくくてフラッとちがうとこに座っちゃったの..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたらみなみがすこしたってから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやのとこきて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「まあやどこ座ってるのー？居なくて寂しい」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってあのかわいい声で言ってきて\n相変わらず天使だなーって思いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても疲れてる時に撮ったら疲れてる顔してる..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人ザテレビジョンの表紙"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レギュラー番組のぎえいごなどみんなコメントとかありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"事務所に行ったからプレゼントもお手紙も沢山もって帰りました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大切に使わせていただきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして年末スペシャルの欅と乃木坂の合同忘年会でMVPを頂いた家電製品も愛用してます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年始はお餅を焼く事が多くて...とってももちもちに仕上がるし美味しい！\n掃除機もお布団もできるしボタン１つでちっさい形で使えたりと優れもの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"満足"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"加湿器？っていうのかな？あれも喉も肌も潤うし髪もしっとりつやつやになって置いて寝てるだけだなるなんて夢のよう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に感謝！\n全部大切に使わせて頂いてます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...澤部さんありがとうございました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0019.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんは新幹線が隣なること多くて\nこの前はずーーーっと話してたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんはまあやの中で1番モノマネレパートリーが多いです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"面倒見のいいお姉さんだなーって思う！でも\n18歳と25歳だけどどこか年齢差を感じさせない無邪気なまいちゅん！会うと\nまいちゅんにはよく大好きって伝える！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嘘だーっていうけど本当だよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしていくちゃんもおめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくちゃんとはこの前、瞼を指でピッてやって二重を一重にして遊んだよね..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人共別人な顔で楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はなんかいろんなメンバーのエピソードが多いね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0025.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではまぁここらへんで"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/01/26/9814535/0024.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}